  "caption_latex": "Physical bath observables at $Jt=1$ from {thirty trajectories with saved physical auxiliary projections} per condition. {(a):} Site-resolved physical bath population $\\langle a_i^\\dagger a_i\\rangle$ for exchange family E. {(b):} Site-averaged real physical bath coherence $\\overline{\\operatorname{Re}\\langle a_i^\\dagger a_{i+r}\\rangle}$ versus separation for E. {(c):} The site-resolved bath population for transverse-XXZ family F. {(d):} The site-averaged real bath coherence versus separation for F. Each panel compares $J_b=0,-2J,+2J$; bands are one standard error, and coherences are averaged over sites inside each trajectory. These environmental observables are distinct from hierarchy boundary weights.",
